{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/bd79f2f4f6f7fd06a6b2bf6fc93b4354.poster.avif?t=1756993338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/bd79f2f4f6f7fd06a6b2bf6fc93b4354.webm?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/bd79f2f4f6f7fd06a6b2bf6fc93b4354.mp4?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become The Cat Bounty Hunter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been hired as a bounty hunter to eradicate dangerous cat-hating, dog-loving monsters. Your arsenal of weaponry ranges from Corporate Pizza Parties and Batling Guns, to Laser Pointers and Kitty Wands. Survive time-based bounty hunts while you wait impatiently for gravity wells to transport you to your next contract. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/87be5c81f9edc9842d19b26528efa69e.poster.avif?t=1756993338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/87be5c81f9edc9842d19b26528efa69e.webm?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/87be5c81f9edc9842d19b26528efa69e.mp4?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purchase Unique Meta Progressions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fish bones during each bounty hunt to unlock permanent abilities and mutations, perks, ship mounts, and even hire new bounty hunters. An achievement-based system is used to reward you after every accomplishment -- because after all, <strong>'<i>curiosity killed the </i></strong><i><span class=\"bb_strike\">cat</span> <strong>bounties'</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/15df7b073fec85891d1f8791f86c08df.poster.avif?t=1756993338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/15df7b073fec85891d1f8791f86c08df.webm?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/extras/15df7b073fec85891d1f8791f86c08df.mp4?t=1756993338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Off Against the Galaxy's Toughest Bounties</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on Elites, Outlaws, and Colossal enemies solo or with up to 4 bounty hunters. As you grow stronger, so will your bounties. Learn from your mistakes and keep striving to unlock the full potential of each bounty hunter -- you'll need it to face what's coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scalable auto-firing weapons and abilities; wield up to 6 unique weapons and 6 cat-themed abilities chosen from 40 available weapons/fusions and 10 available abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating tough bounties will reward you with <u><strong>Purr Packs</strong></u>; the only way to unlock powerful<strong> weapon fusions</strong>\u00a0(when compatible weapons and abilities are paired)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual <strong><u>10-minute</u></strong> bounty hunts; 20-minute Normal bounty hunts and Endless bounty hunts are also available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through deep space with 8 distinctive bounty hunters; with each playable character having a <strong>rechargeable special ability</strong>\u00a0and<strong> unique starting weapon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take bounty hunts to the next level with Local Co-Op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting tuna cans levels your abilities and weapons in-game, while collecting fish bones and bounties allows for purchasing meta-progressions outside of bounty hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the gameplay to your liking with enemy modifiers (health, damage, and speed), 5 difficulty modes (3 unlock-able), and other accessibility features</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621680?t=1756993338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/dfaf44cf585399a0e65cbd4a2d78c741c4936e6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756993338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/1b63202478bbac863d2907ae0a2d60008a13d450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756993338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/1b63202478bbac863d2907ae0a2d60008a13d450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756993338","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Togeth