e weapons and abilities are paired)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual <strong><u>10-minute</u></strong> bounty hunts; 20-minute Normal bounty hunts and Endless bounty hunts are also available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through deep space with 8 distinctive bounty hunters; with each playable character having a <strong>rechargeable special ability</strong>\u00a0and<strong> unique starting weapon</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take bounty hunts to the next level with Local Co-Op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting tuna cans levels your abilities and weapons in-game, while collecting fish bones and bounties allows for purchasing meta-progressions outside of bounty hunts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the gameplay to your liking with enemy modifiers (health, damage, and speed), 5 difficulty modes (3 unlock-able), and other accessibility features</p></li></ul>","developers":["nubes_ix"],"dlc":[3688700],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621680/9f4317a6126bb2fee186b48a5a897b884f0f5f9a/header.jpg?t=1756993338","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Distributions Released Post-2016<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core, 32-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics with Vulkan 1.0 Support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Distributions Released Post-2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan 1.0